[en.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY]
Industry Construction

[en.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_desc]
We don’t know where machines and steam engines will take us, but we do know there will be more jobs, though most of the time creatures of this land just sing and dance through the unemployment days, I guess.

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY]
工业建设

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_desc]
我们不知道机器和蒸汽机会带我们去哪里，但我们知道会有更多的工作岗位，尽管大部分时间这片土地上的生物只是在失业的日子里唱歌跳舞，可能吧。

